  Mode: 45
  Notes: 'OPEN-ENDED, and shell-only like Regatta and Tollway: the gate course is generated by the
    controller at match start (a seeded xorshift walk broadcast as geometry), so a preview
    arena has no rings to thread. What it honestly teaches is the Barren cell it runs in and
    the Dolphin''s drift-and-boost. Intensity is the COURSE, not the arena, so one cell
    serves every intensity. A StructurePrefab of a few standing rings is the recorded gap.'
